    "title": "Emission Scope Type",
    "description": "Classification of different Emission Scope Types for each Emission Category Type.\n\n* Source: The three categories by which the GHG Protocol classifies emissions in order to better\nunderstand the source\n\n  \u25e6 Direct: Scope 1\n\n  \u25e6 Indirect \u2014 Energy: Scope 2\n\n  \u25e6 Indirect \u2014 Value Chain: Scope 3\n\n* Sink:\n\n  \u25e6 Operations (analogous to Scopes 1-2 for sources)\n\n     \u25aa Method: Technology or Nature-based\n  \n  \u25e6 Value Chain (analogous to Scope 3 for sources)\n\n    \u25aa Method: Technology or Nature-based\n* Credit:\n\n  \u25e6 Reduction: Technology, Nature, Hybrid\n \n  \u25e6 Removal: Technology, Nature, Hybrid\n\n  \u25e6 Avoidance: Technology, Nature, Hybrid",
